WEB SOURCE (the specification — read end to end)
  web/src/components/ai/AISoftwareUpdateChangelogSummarizer.tsx. The opt-in, read-only Helix narration
  layer above the deterministic software-update history on SoftwareUpdatesPage (/software-updates and the alias
  /vehicle-systems/software). It NEVER replaces the canonical update timeline (ADR-015 §I3).

    Composition: `AISoftwareUpdateChangelogSummarizer = withAiFeature('software-update-changelog-summarizer',
      InnerSection)`. The HOC gate returns null when the feature is disabled (ADR-015 §I5 / §I6) — no
      data-ai-feature marker enters the DOM. `InnerSection` calls `useAiStream` unconditionally
      (Hooks-rules-safe) and renders the shared `AIFeatureCard`:
        title       = t('softwareUpdates.aiNarration.title', 'Summarize my software update history')
        description = t('softwareUpdates.aiNarration.description', 'Ask Helix to walk through your firmware …')
        buttonLabel = t('softwareUpdates.aiNarration.button', 'Summarize updates')
        badgeLabel  = t('softwareUpdates.aiNarration.badge', 'Helix')
        emptyHint   = haveInputs ? undefined : t('…noVehicleHint', 'Pick a vehicle above to enable Helix.')
        canStart    = haveInputs ; stream = useAiStream({ url:'/ai/software-updates/summarize', body:{vehicle_id} })
      where numericVehicleId = (vehicleId>0 ? vehicleId : 0) and haveInputs = numericVehicleId > 0.
    AIFeatureCard scaffold (web components/ai/AIFeatureCard.tsx): GlassPanel → header (title + Helix AIBadge +
      description + emptyHint when !canStart) → the universal CTA Button ("Ask Helix" idle / "Helix is thinking…"
      streaming, disabled = !canStart || streaming, aria-label = "Ask Helix · {buttonLabel}") → AiOutputPanel.
    AiOutputPanel branches (web components/ai/AiOutputPanel.tsx):
      state==='error'                         → "Helix error: {error ?? t('ai.common.errorUnknown','unknown')}"
      text==='' && state==='streaming'        → AIThinkingIndicator (shimmer skeleton + dots)
      otherwise (any accumulated delta text)  → the narration (whitespace-pre-wrap)
      idle && text===''                       → the panel renders nothing (the card title/description/action stay).
  Hooks  : useSelectedVehicle (vehicle_id), useTranslation, useAiStream (SSE lifecycle: state + delta text + error).
  i18n   : every user-visible key says "Helix", not "AI" (HX addendum). The shared Helix vocabulary
           (helix.askHelix / helix.thinking / helix.errorLabel / ai.common.errorUnknown) lives in AIFeatureCard /
           AiOutputPanel; reproduced in this surface's table because those atomic peers are out of scope here.

