STATES (every non-gated one renders — no hidden surface)
  gated    → feature disabled → the whole surface is withdrawn (EmptyView), reproducing web withAiFeature null
             (ADR-015 §I5). NOT a hidden section: when the feature is on but no stream has run, the idle stand-in
             renders.
  loading  → pre-first-snapshot skeleton chrome (badge/title/description/panel stand-ins) while the gate +
             active vehicle resolve.
  empty    → the never-blank idle stand-in ("Run Helix to summarize your firmware update history.") + the
             "Pick a vehicle above to enable Helix." hint when no vehicle is in scope (web emptyHint).
  error    → the AiOutputPanel "Helix error: {message}" line + a P4 leaf Retry affordance.
  ready    → title + Helix badge + description + the "Ask Helix" / "Helix is thinking…" action + the output
             region (idle / thinking skeleton / streamed narration / terminal narration).
  stale    → header chip + banner + one-shot auto-refresh on the live→stale transition.
  offline  → header chip + banner over the last Helix summary (cached); the action is held (the SSE cannot open).

